Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the high‑performing pool1 using inverse error to see if a focused weighted mean beats the best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination on pool2 to see if a different subset yields a better score.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
