Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination on pool1 to see if a more focused weighted blend beats the best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse-error combination on pool3 to see if adding the rf model improves over pool1 results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple median over pool1 to see if a non‑mean robust aggregator beats the weighted combo on this subset.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

